  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="DE">Deutsche Beteiligung an der 16. Wiederauff&#xfc;llung des Afrikanischen Entwicklungsfonds (AfDF 16)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">German Contribution to the 16th Replenishment of the African Development Fund (AfDF 16)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AfDF 16 will focus primarily on sustainable and climate-resilient infrastructure investments in the areas Financing agriculture, energy, transport, water and health. At least 40% The funds should flow into climate financing, 50% of which goes into climate adaptation</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="DE">AfDF 16 wird vor allem nachhaltige und klimaresistente Infrastrukturinvestitionen in den Bereichen Landwirtschaft, Energie, Verkehr, Wasser sowie Gesundheit finanzieren. Mindestens 40 % der Mittel sollen in Klimafinanzierung flie&#xdf;en, davon 50 % in Klimaanpassung</narrative>
  </description>
